@startuml offline_status_geometry
title Offline status refresh: presentation regression
participant "Hosted HomeView\nAppModule" as View
participant "HomeFeature\nCore" as Home
participant "Controlled offline reply\nTest double" as Offline
participant "Rendered geometry\nTest observer" as Geometry

note over View, Geometry
  Initial status: unknown, sealed, or unsealed.
  Error visible; animations enabled during measurement.
  Measure the button's bounds (frame or path bounds),
  and the rendered icon inside its fixed column.
  VoiceOver activation points are not layout centers.
  Intrinsic vertical sizing and fixed gaps in the status card prevent it from
  growing when the feedback below the button disappears.
  A flexible text column keeps the action icon's x position fixed.
end note
View -> Geometry: Record initial button and icon position
View -> Home: refreshTapped (animated transaction)
Home -> View: checkingStatus; hide feedback
Home -> Offline: status(profile)
View -> Geometry: Sample the transition and pending layout
Offline --> Home: Connection failure
Home -> View: unknown status; show error
View -> Geometry: Sample the transition and final layout
note over Geometry
  Button bounds remain fixed.
  Icon stays in the same column, centered vertically,
  and inside the button throughout both transitions.
end note
@enduml

@startuml authorization_clock_synchronization
title Authorization gate: deterministic virtual time
participant "Client test" as Test
participant "Live controller\nAppModule" as Controller
participant "Controlled Face ID" as FaceID
participant "Controlled foreground sleep" as Sleep
participant "TestClock" as Clock

Test -> Controller: Start protected operation
Controller -> FaceID: Request authorization
Test -> Test: Apply inactive/background gate
Test -> FaceID: Complete authorization
FaceID --> Controller: Success
Controller -> Sleep: First 100 ms sleep request
Sleep --> Test: Signal first sleep request
Sleep -> Clock: Register suspension
Test -> Clock: Advance 5 s only after wait starts
loop TestClock yields between 50 bounded sleeps
  Clock --> Controller: Resume wait
  opt More foreground waits remain
    Controller -> Sleep: Next 100 ms sleep request
    Sleep -> Clock: Register suspension
  end
end
Controller --> Test: AppFailure after 50 waits
note over Test, Controller
  Assert zero storage access and invalidated context.
  Active-but-locked/captured gates fail without sleep.
  Tests preserve the production authorization checks.
end note
@enduml

@startuml presented_material_stability
title Native sheet snapshots: wait for rendered stability
participant "Privacy test" as Test
participant "Hosted sheet\nUIKit / SwiftUI" as Sheet
participant "Snapshot renderer" as Renderer

Test -> Sheet: Present sheet / update disabled controls
Test -> Sheet: Wait for semantic state and transition completion
loop At most 8 captures, separated by a run-loop turn
  Test -> Sheet: Layout and freeze native spinners
  Sheet -> Renderer: Render current window
  Renderer --> Test: Complete PNG pixels
  Test -> Test: Compare successive renders exactly
  break At least 4 captures and 3 consecutive identical renders
    Test -> Test: Continue with exact golden image comparison
  end
end
note over Test
  Fail if native rendering does not settle.
  Keep golden-image precision and privacy assertions unchanged.
  Do not advance the feature's virtual clock during settling.
end note
@enduml
